      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought wildcard was only for MCC/MNC?\n\nThe comment says \"this must match exactly\", but patternMatch accounts for the wildcard character. SPN wildcard matching seems unexpected and unreasonable - \"I want to blacklist all carriers with a 7 letter SPN.\" Possible, but nonsensical.\n\nI think this should be strict equality. Same goes for all the fields below. TextUtils.equals() may be reasonable here.",
